<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Event Loop kh=C3=B4ng ph=E1=BA=
=A3i l=C3=A0 invention c=E1=BB=A7a JavaScript. Concept n=C3=A0y originated =
from event-driven programming paradigms trong early operating systems v=C3=
=A0 GUI frameworks. JavaScript adopted n=C3=B3 to solve fundamental problem=
: <strong>how to handle I/O operations without blocking user interface</str=
ong>.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Pre-JavaScript Era Conte=
xt:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
