<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">No user interaction beyond hype=
rlinks</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">No real-time data updates</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">No complex UI behaviors</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>The JavaScript Revolutio=
n Requirements:</strong></p>
