b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Handle user interactions (click=
s, scrolls, typing)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Perform network requests withou=
t freezing page</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Update DOM dynamically</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Manage timers v=C3=A0 animation=
s</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">All while maintaining responsiv=
e UI</li>
</ol>
